 r←req Divide payload
⍝ Stretch goal: return payload.a divided by payload.b, e.g. {"a":6,"b":3} gives 2
⍝ A dyadic endpoint receives the request as its left argument; req.Fail sets an HTTP error status
 :If 0=payload.b
     r←'Cannot divide by zero'
     'Cannot divide by zero'req.Fail 400
 :Else
     r←payload.a÷payload.b
 :EndIf
